      "passageHtml": "<div class=\"source-doc\" style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7d0c4;border-radius:7px;padding:17px 20px;line-height:1.65;color:#25231f;overflow-wrap:anywhere\"><div style=\"max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;background:#f3f4f5;border:2px solid #747b80;border-radius:14px;padding:14px\"><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 13px;margin:8px 45px 8px 0\"><b>Jim Szymanski (9:42 A.M.)</b><div>Bev, I want to give you a heads-up. There’s a broken water valve at the Eastbury Student Apartments. The water there will be shut off for 2 hours.</div></div><div style=\"background:#ebf5e9;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 13px;margin:8px 0 8px 45px\"><b>Bev Munoz (9:43 A.M.)</b><div>No problem. We can wash our hands at the Carlton Apartments after we finish this job.</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 13px;margin:8px 45px 8px 0\"><b>Jim Szymanski (9:44 A.M.)</b><div>Right. We’ll be doing the same thing this morning as we did last time. We’ll enter each apartment unit and vacuum out the filter in the wall air conditioner. Any filter that looks too dusty should be replaced. Also, we should clear out debris from the vents.</div></div><div style=\"background:#ebf5e9;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 13px;margin:8px 0 8px 45px\"><b>Bev Munoz (9:46 A.M.)</b><div>Got it. Will all the apartments be unoccupied?</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 13px;margin:8px 45px 8px 0\"><b>Jim Szymanski (9:47 A.M.)</b><div>The students are on school holiday. But you may want to knock on the doors just in case.</div></div><div style=\"background:#ebf5e9;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 13px;margin:8px 0 8px 45px\"><b>Bev Munoz (9:48 A.M.)</b><div>OK. I can handle Building A because I’m parked nearby. You could work on Building B. The work will go more quickly that way, and we’ll have time for an afternoon lunch break.</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 13px;margin:8px 45px 8px 0\"><b>Jim Szymanski (9:49 A.M.)</b><div>Exactly. Let me know if you need anything else this morning.</div></div></div></div>",
